{title: It feels so good to be free}

{comment: Chorus}
It feels so good, it feels so good to be free
I’ve been born again, freed from sin and I’m a child of the King
So glad to be walking in grace and liberty
I’m here to tell the world that it feels to good to be free.

{comment: Bridge}
Since sin has been defeated, I’m a brand new man
I’ve been justified, sanctified, washed by the blood of the lamb
